1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,118
You sit down to study at eight

2
00:00:03,118 --> 00:00:05,107
By nine, you've read one page

3
00:00:05,107 --> 00:00:07,152
and opened fourteen tabs

4
00:00:07,522 --> 00:00:08,923
So you install a blocker

5
00:00:08,923 --> 00:00:10,823
and it wants you to sign up

6
00:00:11,993 --> 00:00:13,884
Study Duo is a study timer

7
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:16,247
that lives in your browser

8
00:00:16,247 --> 00:00:19,147
Free, offline, and it never phones home

9
00:00:19,717 --> 00:00:22,815
Your deadlines come in from your course calendar

10
00:00:23,285 --> 00:00:25,238
Pick one and press Start

11
00:00:25,908 --> 00:00:27,046
A small clock sits

12
00:00:27,046 --> 00:00:28,816
in the corner of every page

13
00:00:28,816 --> 00:00:30,726
and fades while you read

14
00:00:31,396 --> 00:00:35,210
Distracting sites stay closed until the block ends

15
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:38,813
Opening one anyway takes ten seconds and a reason

16
00:00:39,783 --> 00:00:42,786
Under the timer sits a record player

17
00:00:42,786 --> 00:00:44,609
White, pink or brown noise

18
00:00:44,609 --> 00:00:46,019
made right here

19
00:00:50,489 --> 00:00:52,248
Point it at your music folder

20
00:00:52,248 --> 00:00:54,336
and it plays like a music app

21
00:00:57,406 --> 00:00:59,642
A YouTube or Spotify link plays

22
00:00:59,642 --> 00:01:01,441
in the side panel

23
00:01:01,441 --> 00:01:02,510
The popup plays

24
00:01:02,510 --> 00:01:04,176
pauses and skips it

25
00:01:04,746 --> 00:01:07,015
Music already playing in another tab?

26
00:01:07,015 --> 00:01:09,185
Pause it or skip it from here

27
00:01:12,755 --> 00:01:13,751
When time's up

28
00:01:13,751 --> 00:01:14,548
a bell rings

29
00:01:14,548 --> 00:01:16,937
and the page tells you to rest

30
00:01:18,107 --> 00:01:20,539
One tap says how focused you were

31
00:01:21,409 --> 00:01:22,527
After a few weeks

32
00:01:22,527 --> 00:01:24,330
it knows your best hours

33
00:01:24,330 --> 00:01:27,142
and which songs actually help you focus

34
00:01:28,412 --> 00:01:29,695
Every block can land

35
00:01:29,695 --> 00:01:32,207
in your Google Calendar by itself

36
00:01:32,977 --> 00:01:33,755
New laptop?

37
00:01:33,755 --> 00:01:35,808
Move your settings and to-dos

38
00:01:35,808 --> 00:01:37,553
over with a QR code

39
00:01:38,423 --> 00:01:42,293
We measured it next to five other focus extensions

40
00:01:42,293 --> 00:01:44,163
When we installed BlockSite

41
00:01:44,163 --> 00:01:47,401
it contacted fifty-seven outside servers

42
00:01:47,401 --> 00:01:49,701
Study Duo contacted none

43
00:01:50,771 --> 00:01:52,422
The paid focus apps cost

44
00:01:52,422 --> 00:01:55,229
up to nineteen ninety-nine a month

45
00:01:55,229 --> 00:01:57,032
All of this is free

46
00:01:58,302 --> 00:01:59,170
Study Duo

47
00:01:59,170 --> 00:02:01,322
Free and open source
